                                   DriveHighlightSlideProjection, DriveHighlightSlideRegistration, DriveHighlightSlideDiagnostics)
  - DriveHighlightSlide.cs        (WinUI 3 view: ContentControl rendering the content / empty web branches)
Tests (required by acceptance + gate): apps/windows/TeslaSync.App.Tests/FeatureViews/DriveHighlightSlideTests.cs (31 tests)
  + DriveHighlightSlide.Model.cs linked into TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj (headless net10.0 adapter/projection verification).

Web source parity (web/src/features/analytics/components/review/DriveHighlightSlide.tsx):
  States reproduced: drive ? Content (emoji + label + glass card: route, distance, duration, efficiency, date)
    : Empty (emoji over t('yearReview.noDriveData','No drive data for this year')). The web source is presentational
    (props drive/label/emoji; hooks useTranslation + useUnits only), so there is no fetch-driven loading/error/stale/
    offline branch to reproduce -- the parent year-in-review page owns those, exactly as the AuditPanel/ResultPanel ports document.
  Data sources mapped: useTranslation -> ILocalizer facade; useUnits -> UnitPref (settable Units property; no HTTP in the view).
  Shared components mapped: @/components/motion (framer-motion staggered entrance) -> TsStaggerContainer (OS reduce-motion aware);
    glass card -> TsGlassPanel; lucide MapPin/ArrowRight/Clock/Zap -> Segoe Fluent glyphs E81D/E72A/E823/E945 (decorative, AccessibilityView.Raw);
    typography -> Caption/MetricValue/MetricLabel + tokenized DisplayTokens brushes (no raw hex).
  Units: convertDistanceFromSI(distance_km*1000, unit) -> UnitConverters.DistanceFromSi; efficiency * KM_PER_MILE (1.609344)
    for miles; JavaScript Math.round (round-half-up) reproduced; "Wh/mi"/"Wh/km" labels and "{h}h {m}m" duration. SI is read
    and converted only at the display boundary (Phase-48 contract).
  i18n: yearReview.noDriveData + yearReview.duration resolve through the P1/S10 ILocalizer facade and are present in
    Strings/{en,ar,he}/Resources.resw ("No drive data for this year" / "duration"); no English literals beyond the
    fallbacks the web t() also passes.
  Accessibility: surface Narrator name in both states (composed label/route/stats/date, or the empty message); decorative
    icons + emoji are AccessibilityView.Raw; the empty state is a live region; TextBlocks honour the system font scale;
    the entrance honours OS reduce-motion via TsStaggerContainer.
  Telemetry: DriveHighlightSlideDiagnostics emits "view.opened slug=DriveHighlightSlide" (PII-safe; never distance/address/
    date/drive id) on first load.

